          "username": "agentic",
          "bot_id": "B0FAKEBOT01",
          "type": "message",
          "subtype": "bot_message",
          "ts": "1780000000.000100"
        }
      },
      "source": {
        "url": "https://docs.slack.dev/reference/methods/chat.postMessage",
        "retrieved": "2026-09-10",
        "kind": "documented",
        "note": "The page's example success response, with the channel, ts, bot_id and text replaced by obviously fake ones (BD-002) and the `attachments` array removed — this adapter never sends attachments and never reads them back."
