          "text": "Which currency should totals use?",
          "bot_id": "B0FAKEBOT01",
          "type": "message",
          "subtype": "bot_message",
          "ts": "1780000001.000200",
          "thread_ts": "1780000000.000100"
        }
      },
      "source": {
        "url": "https://docs.slack.dev/reference/methods/chat.postMessage",
        "retrieved": "2026-09-10",
        "kind": "documented-adapted",
        "note": "The same example response, adapted for a threaded reply: `thread_ts` is a documented *argument* of the method ('Provide another message's ts value to post this message in a thread') but the page's example response does not show it echoed in `message`. The adapter reads only `ok`, `channel` and `ts`."
      }
    },
    {
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/chat.postMessage",
      "match": {
        "channel": "C0FAKECHAN1",
